  "segments": [
    {
      "id": "dev-criteria-usual-qa:seg:0",
      "text": "Release 4.2. Diego, is everything merged?"
    },
    {
      "id": "dev-criteria-usual-qa:seg:1",
      "text": "Everything except the offline drafts fix. That's in review and should land today."
    },
    {
      "id": "dev-criteria-usual-qa:seg:2",
      "text": "Is offline drafts the one that lost text on Android when you rotated the phone?"
    },
    {
      "id": "dev-criteria-usual-qa:seg:3",
      "text": "That's the one. Turned out to be an activity lifecycle thing."
    },
    {
      "id": "dev-criteria-usual-qa:seg:4",
      "text": "App store review is taking a day or two lately. When can we submit?"
    },
    {
      "id": "dev-criteria-usual-qa:seg:5",
      "text": "Once the fix lands and it's been through QA."
    },
    {
      "id": "dev-criteria-usual-qa:seg:6",
      "text": "We'll do the usual QA pass on the release build."
    },
    {
      "id": "dev-criteria-usual-qa:seg:7",
      "text": "Great. Then let's submit Wednesday if the usual QA pass is clean."
    },
    {
      "id": "dev-criteria-usual-qa:seg:8",
      "text": "Wednesday works."
    },
    {
      "id": "dev-criteria-usual-qa:seg:9",
      "text": "OK."
    },
    {
      "id": "dev-criteria-usual-qa:seg:10",
      "text": "Release notes. Who's writing them?"
    },
    {
      "id": "dev-criteria-usual-qa:seg:11",
      "text": "I'll draft them from the changelog and send them to you."
    },
    {
      "id": "dev-criteria-usual-qa:seg:12",
      "text": "Thanks. Keep them short, three bullets at most."
    },
    {
      "id": "dev-criteria-usual-qa:seg:13",
      "text": "Can we mention the rotation fix? A lot of store reviews complained about it."
    },
    {
      "id": "dev-criteria-usual-qa:seg:14",
      "text": "Yes, lead with that."
    },
    {
      "id": "dev-criteria-usual-qa:seg:15",
      "text": "Also, the new onboarding screens are behind a flag. They ship dark."
    },
    {
      "id": "dev-criteria-usual-qa:seg:16",
      "text": "Good. We'll turn them on once the A/B setup is ready."
    },
    {
      "id": "dev-criteria-usual-qa:seg:17",
      "text": "Then I'll skip onboarding this round."
    },
    {
      "id": "dev-criteria-usual-qa:seg:18",
      "text": "Agreed. Anything else for 4.2?"
    },
    {
      "id": "dev-criteria-usual-qa:seg:19",
      "text": "The crash reporter upgrade went in last week. Nothing to do, just so you know."
    },
    {
      "id": "dev-criteria-usual-qa:seg:20",
      "text": "Noted. Thanks, both."
    }
  ],
